#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "The app and everything it saved in Android are removed."
msgstr "Aplikasi jeung sagala nu disimpen dina Android bakal dipiceun."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "You can install it again from the store at any time."
msgstr "Ibu/Bapa tiasa masang deui tina toko iraha waé."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Turn off Android?"
msgstr "Pareuman Android?"

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Android apps that are open close. Android stays off, also after you log in again, until you open an Android app or turn it on here."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android anu kabuka bakal ditutup. Android tetep pareum, ogé saatos anjeun asup deui, dugi ka anjeun muka aplikasi Android atanapi ngahurungkeunana di dieu."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "Turn on Android apps?"
msgstr "Hurungkeun aplikasi Android?"

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "F-Droid apps are Android apps: they run in Android (lapis) beside the desktop. Turning it on downloads Android once (about 1.3 GB) and may ask for your password. Store settings show how it goes."
msgstr "Aplikasi F-Droid téh aplikasi Android: jalan di Android (lapis) di gigireun desktop. Ngahurungkeunana ngundeur Android sakali (kira-kira 1,3 GB) sareng tiasa naroskeun kecap konci anjeun. Setélan toko nunjukkeun kamajuanana."

#: src/ui/store_window.cpp
msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

#: src/ui/widgets.cpp
msgid "Edit"
msgstr "Édit"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Lengkahan"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Balik"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Start the tour"
msgstr "Mimitian tur"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "Mimitian"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Teras"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "WELCOME"
msgstr "WILUJENG SAMPEURKEUN"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Welcome to IGN 26"
msgstr "Wilujeng sumping di IGN 26"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Bayu is ready to use. Take a short tour, under a minute, to find your way around."
msgstr "Bayu parantos siap dianggo. Tuturkeun tur ringkes, kirang ti semenit, supados terang jalanna."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "BAYU STORE"
msgstr "BAYU STORE"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Install your first app"
msgstr "Pasang aplikasi anu mimiti"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Bayu Store brings thousands of apps from Flathub and F-Droid together. Search, click Install, and it is done. Some to start with:"
msgstr "Bayu Store ngahijikeun rébuan aplikasi ti Flathub jeung F-Droid. Téangan, klik Pasang, tuluy anggeus. Sawatara pikeun ngamimitian:"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Browse the web"
msgstr "Ngulik wéb"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Documents, spreadsheets and slides"
msgstr "Dokumén, lembar kerja, jeung slide"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Plays any video or music"
msgstr "Muter video atawa musik naon waé"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Bayu Store"
msgstr "Buka Bayu Store"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "LAUNCHER AND DOCK"
msgstr "LAUNCHER JEUNG DOCK"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Find every app"
msgstr "Mendakan sadaya aplikasi"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Click the rocket in the dock to see all your apps, and type to search. Apps you install appear there at once. Drag one to the dock to keep it at hand."
msgstr "Klik rokét di dock pikeun ningali sadaya aplikasi anjeun, tuluy ketik pikeun néangan. Aplikasi anu dipasang langsung muncul di dinya. Seret hiji ka dock supados gampang kahontal."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Run Android apps"
msgstr "Jalankeun aplikasi Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps run in their own windows, next to your other apps, through lapis. Turning it on downloads Android once, about 1.3 GB."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android jalan dina jandéla sorangan, gigireun aplikasi anjeun anu séjén, ngaliwatan lapis. Ngaktipkeunana ngundeur Android sakali, kira-kira 1,3 GB."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "APPEARANCE"
msgstr "TAMPILAN"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Make it yours"
msgstr "Jieun saluyu jeung kahayang anjeun"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Choose light or dark, and a wallpaper. More choices are in Settings."
msgstr "Pilih caang atawa poék, jeung wallpaper. Pilihan sanésna aya dina Setélan."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "DESKTOP LAYOUT"
msgstr "TATA PERENAH DESKTOP"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Dock or panel"
msgstr "Dock atanapi panél"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "The Dock keeps a bar at the top, with the menus of the app in front, and your apps in a dock. The Panel puts everything in one bar along the bottom, with each app's menus in its window. The desktop changes at once."
msgstr "Dock nyimpen bar di luhur, eusina ménu aplikasi anu nuju dianggo, sareng aplikasi anjeun dina dock. Panél nempatkeun sadayana dina hiji bar di handap, kalayan ménu unggal aplikasi dina jandélana. Desktop langsung robah."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Stay up to date"
msgstr "Sing salawasna anyar"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "App updates are in Bayu Store, under Updates. System updates are in Settings, under System Update: they download in the background and install when you restart."
msgstr "Pembaruan aplikasi aya di Bayu Store, dina bagian Pembaruan. Pembaruan sistem aya di Setélan, dina bagian Pembaruan Sistem: diundeur di tukang sareng dipasang nalika anjeun ngamimitian deui."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Updates"
msgstr "Buka Pembaruan"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "System Update"
msgstr "Pembaruan Sistem"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Report a problem"
msgstr "Laporkeun masalah"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "ALL SET"
msgstr "SADAYA PARANTOS SIAP"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Enjoy IGN 26"
msgstr "Wilujeng ngagunakeun IGN 26"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open this tour again any time from the launcher: look for Welcome."
msgstr "Buka tur ieu deui iraha waé ti launcher: téangan Wilujeng Sumping."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Show at login"
msgstr "Témbongkeun nalika asup"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Welcome each time you sign in"
msgstr "Buka Wilujeng Sumping unggal asup"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps are not available on this system."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android teu sayogi dina sistem ieu."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Turn on Android apps"
msgstr "Aktipkeun aplikasi Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Android apps are on. Find them in Bayu Store under F-Droid."
msgstr "Aplikasi Android parantos diaktipkeun. Mendakan dina Bayu Store di F-Droid."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Setting up Android"
msgstr "Nyiapkeun Android"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Waiting for your password."
msgstr "Ngantosan kecap konci anjeun."

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Downloading Android: {done} of {total}"
msgstr "Ngundeur Android: {done} tina {total}"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "Mode poék"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Open Settings"
msgstr "Buka Setélan"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Dock"
msgstr "Dock"

#: src/welcome/main.cpp
msgid "Panel"
msgstr "Panél"

